// Markets by area: partners meet where they live. A small national
// share pairs across areas (couples who met far apart); provisional,
// calibrated on the share of natives living outside their birth state
// (residence_realism) and on the about 25% of couples who lived more than
// 50 km apart before moving in together (research note §5d).
(
    national_market_share: [(1840, 0.06), (1950, 0.08), (2020, 0.10)],
    local_open_markets: true,
)
